My plan: Since openspec provided empty acceptance criteria, I will create a full set of observable, testable ACs from the story description and technical notes. I'll cover: (1) live preview initialization and activation, (2) real-time content update behavior without page reload, (3) graceful fallback when not in preview mode, (4) error/reconnection handling, (5) security (no credential leakage to client), (6) accessibility of dynamically updated content, and (7) compatibility with existing components (useContent, ContentstackContext, ContentstackLink). Every AC will be a Given/When/Then observable outcome — no implementation instructions. Since openspec gave empty ACs, all criteria will be in acAddedBySpeckit. I'll note the caveat that file contents were unavailable. I will NOT include splitStories. I'll know I'm wrong if any AC names a mock pattern, library, or import.

